sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant App
    participant Store as Order store
    User->>App: Place the order
    activate App
    App->>Store: Save the order
    Store-->>App: Saved
    alt paid
        App-->>User: Confirmation
    else declined
        App--xUser: Try another card
    end
    deactivate App
    Note over App,Store: Orders are kept for a year
